    "created_at": "2026-11-28T00:27:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-28T00:27:44Z",
    "body": "One more point for the circular mode:\n\n**Count.** Please state in the schema, the UI text and the MCP tool whether `count` includes the original. CAM programs do not agree on this: some count the total, others count only the extra copies. A misunderstanding adds or drops one copy without a warning. Proposal: `count` is the total number of positions, including the original (copy 0), the same as the linear and grid modes of #3012. Write it in the hover text and the MCP tool description.\n\nDone means adds: a test that pins the count convention (for example `count: 4`, `angle_step_deg: 90` gives exactly 4 positions at 0, 90, 180 and 270 degrees).\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
